没钱风
In stark contrast to its forerunner, the "old money" dress code, which in imitates the refined fashion of the upper class, the dirty fit champions a unique and unrestrained look. Dirty fit exudes a profound sense of freedom and spontaneity, much like a wild plant thriving amid chaos in an untamed field. However, in videos and photos showcasing dirty fit fashion keen observers will discern that beneath the seemingly shabby and unkempt facade lies cutting-edge design straight form the runway. This subtle form of luxury seems to be another clever fashion trick. The essence of dirty fit lies in the refusal to be concerned with how one's attire is perceived by others.